\title{gpsadb: R Client for the 'GPSAdb' Genetic Perturbation Database}
\description{
Query 'GPSAdb', a database of genetic perturbation RNA-seq datasets with precomputed differential expression and gene set enrichment, and run its signature-matching tools from R. Data is retrieved over the database's Model Context Protocol ('MCP') endpoint using the 'aisdk.mcp' client, and results are returned as tibbles. Covers dataset search and metadata, per-dataset differential expression and 'GSEA', reverse lookups across every dataset, and signature search ('BioTrigger', 'fastGPSA'). Reference: Guo et al. (2026) \doi{10.1093/nar/gkaf1077}.
